# A fight through the real input path: a yard dog put in front of the player,
# walked up to, struck, dodged, struck again. Boot with:
#   tools/tour.sh tours/fight.tour --seed=1 --at=58,100 --hour=12 --spawn=dog.yard
wait 0.4
shot 01-met
walk 1,-1 0.35
tap swing
wait 0.12
shot 02-swing
wait 0.35
tap dodge
wait 0.06
shot 03-dodge
wait 0.3
tap swing
wait 0.15
shot 04-again
wait 1.2
shot 05-after
